icker'>PRIVACY</p><h2>No hidden account collection</h2><p>This preview does not create an online account. Final legal text is not published here; the Legal page records that boundary without inventing policy language.</p><a href='/legal/'>Legal status</a></article></section><aside class='toadal-companion' data-companion data-zone='hero' aria-label='Toadal contextual helper'><div class='companion-panel' id='toadal-companion-panel' data-companion-panel><p class='companion-label'>TOADAL SAYS</p><p class='companion-message' data-companion-speech aria-live='polite' aria-atomic='true'>Account services are not connected yet. Your current website progress can remain local to this browser.</p></div><button class='companion-toggle' type='button' data-companion-toggle aria-controls='toadal-companion-panel' aria-expanded='true' aria-label='Minimize Toadal helper'><img class='companion-image' data-companion-image src='/assets/images/characters/toadal-victory.png' alt='' width='611' height='640' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><span class='sr-only'>Minimize Toadal helper</span></button></aside></article>"
